1
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,039
What do you mean, "Taiwanese spies"?

2
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,599
They're Taiwanese businessmen!

3
00:03:00,599 --> 00:03:02,039
Are we going to shake this label or not?

4
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:02,719
Who's going to do it?

5
00:03:02,719 --> 00:03:03,319
Is it you?

6
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,639
My son went to the mainland for legitimate business!

7
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:07,800
You're the ones who forced him into this damn mess!

8
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,520
Word of Operation Spring Thunder

9
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,680
couldn't have leaked this fast.

10
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,159
Straight to the press overnight.

11
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,439
There's definitely a mole among us.

12
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:24,879
Just listen to me.

13
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:26,120
What good is all this talk?

14
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,560
If there's a mole, catch them!

15
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,280
Every single time,

16
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:31,479
it's always after the fact.

17
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:33,680
I don't even know how to report this up.

18
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,599
Stop dwelling on the past.

19
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,199
Going forward,

20
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,199
how do we tighten control?

21
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,159
Do you have a plan?

22
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:22,800
Up so early?

23
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,399
What client is in such a rush?

24
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:33,360
Heading out of the province?

25
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,959
Wherever it is, I'm going to be late.

26
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:37,319
Is your driver coming today?

27
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,759
Yeah, he is.

28
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:39,480
On call anytime.

29
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,560
Need a ride to work?

30
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,000
Since I'm in a rush, I won't say no.

31
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,839
Didn't sleep well last night?

32
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,199
Such dark circles under your eyes.

33
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:55,720
In such a hurry today,

34
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,639
where are you off to?

35
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:59,000
Zhangzhou today, a day trip.

36
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:00,360
Is Zhangzhou fun?

37
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,160
I've never been.

38
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,800
Aren't they all pretty much the same?

39
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:07,720
Poor sleep easily puts you in a bad mood.

40
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:10,720
I heard chocolate cheers you up.

41
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:11,839
Have one.

42
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,199
If she won't have it, you eat it.

43
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:16,759
Thanks, Boss.

44
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:29,519
Haven't seen your boyfriend around lately.

45
00:05:30,279 --> 00:05:31,439
He didn't come see you today either.

46
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,000
He's dead.

47
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,600
They definitely broke up.

48
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:46,560
Maybe there's someone new already.

49
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,399
A newcomer who looks pretty familiar.

50
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,199
Head to the auto mall first.

51
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:03,720
All right.

52
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,199
Enjoy your meal.

53
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:08,879
Thank you.

54
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,040
Spring Thunder has struck.

55
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:27,120
Notify the target.

56
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,720
The park rendezvous is canceled.

57
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:16,079
Your safety is the top priority.

58
00:07:16,959 --> 00:07:19,199
No matter when or where we meet,

59
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,639
if the agreed arrangement changes at all,

60
00:07:21,639 --> 00:07:23,240
switch to Plan B immediately.

61
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,040
For instance,

62
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:28,120
traffic jams, delays, damaged roads,

63
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,759
a fight breaking out at the meeting spot,

64
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:31,560
or even someone taking the agreed location.

65
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,480
Whatever the reason,

66
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,959
the rendezvous must be aborted.

67
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:38,639
Any coincidence might not be a coincidence.

68
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,199
If anything goes wrong with the time or place,

69
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,560
Plan A is canceled on the spot.

70
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,319
At exactly 9:00 p.m. that evening,

71
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,120
the handover location

72
00:07:53,439 --> 00:07:55,720
will move to Pacific Nightclub on Yunzhong Road.

73
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,240
Leave the goods in place, and someone will take them.

74
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:06,439
This guy really comes out running every day.

75
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,040
For how long?

76
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:09,399
A month, or a year?

77
00:08:10,199 --> 00:08:11,279
Rain or shine.

78
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,120
There really is thunder, huh?

79
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,560
What else?

80
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,519
Everything, of course.

81
00:08:19,879 --> 00:08:20,839
Let me repeat myself.

82
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,160
Anything related to Cao Liaoping,

83
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,120
there's no such thing as too much.

84
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,040
I want it all.

85
00:08:34,759 --> 00:08:36,039
What's the situation on your end?

86
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,440
Cao Liaoping is most likely dirty.

87
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,919
He knows meeting protocols and contingencies inside out.

88
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:43,519
Trying to hide it only makes it more obvious.

89
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,480
Set up surveillance on him.

90
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:49,519
Boss.

91
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:51,679
I waited for a long time, but nobody went in.

92
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:53,159
That car dealer was probably conning you.

93
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,600
Who claimed you could get a private refund?

94
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,799
The boss or the salesman?

95
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,120
Everyone's out to scam me.

96
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,480
Lesson learned.

97
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:00,200
Page Jin Lina.

98
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:01,279
Tell her to get over here right away.

99
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:03,159
We'll meet at the bus station.

100
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,600
The bus station? Where are we going?

101
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,399
A day tour to Zhangzhou.

102
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:08,519
Shenzhou Strait Travel Agency!

103
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:09,720
Heading to Zhangzhou, right?

104
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,480
Come this way.

105
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,200
Grab me something to eat.

106
00:09:19,639 --> 00:09:20,039
Sure.

107
00:09:21,559 --> 00:09:23,159
Quanzhou day tour!

108
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,440
Help me shift this over that way.

109
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,919
Help me move it over there.

110
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:32,279
Here, let me give you a hand.

111
00:09:32,279 --> 00:09:33,519
All right, don't worry.

112
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:35,639
A bit further over. Thanks.

113
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,799
Thanks, Brother Cheng.

114
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:37,960
Thanks, Brother Qiang.

115
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,399
You can come back once the bus pulls out.

116
00:09:39,879 --> 00:09:41,519
Ma'am, could you please move yours too?

117
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:43,240
Don't want the bus scratching it when it pulls in.

118
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,360
Who do you think you are?

119
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,399
Why should I listen to you?

120
00:09:45,679 --> 00:09:46,720
The bus is pulling in any minute.

121
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:47,519
Look...

122
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:48,120
Let... let me give you a hand.

123
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:48,679
Just do what she says.

124
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:49,600
Move it over there.

125
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,519
She's my wife.

126
00:09:50,519 --> 00:09:51,399
Can't sit still at home.

127
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,320
Insisted on tagging along with me.

128
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,360
Doesn't know how anything works out here.

129
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,559
Are you still hiring anyone?

130
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,080
I'll keep an eye out for you.

131
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,519
Thanks, bro.

132
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:59,240
Shenzhou Strait Travel Agency!

133
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,159
Hold on to your bags!

134
00:10:03,279 --> 00:10:04,480
Watch your belongings!

135
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:06,240
Remember to pick me up on time.

136
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:06,879
Will do.

137
00:10:06,879 --> 00:10:07,919
Board in an orderly line!

138
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,519
Hold on to your bags!

139
00:10:09,519 --> 00:10:10,840
Keep an eye on your belongings!

140
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:11,840
Ma'am.

141
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,039
Zip up your bag properly.

142
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,879
If anyone loses anything on this trip,

143
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:16,320
my bonus gets docked too.

144
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:17,679
Right, right. Thank you.

145
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:18,639
Move toward the back.

146
00:10:18,639 --> 00:10:19,080
Find an empty seat.

147
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:19,639
Sister Lan.

148
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,080
Boss Lin.

149
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,480
What brings you here?

150
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,759
Aren't I welcome?

151
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:24,919
Of course you are!

152
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,879
Boss.

153
00:10:33,039 --> 00:10:33,799
My homeroom teacher...

154
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,279
got appendicitis,

155
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,840
and ended up in the hospital.

156
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,799
I couldn't get a leave slip signed.

157
00:10:38,799 --> 00:10:40,679
So I just came straight here, no matter what.

158
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,879
Getting on the bus now.

159
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,519
Come on, get in.

160
00:10:46,639 --> 00:10:47,720
Hello, everyone!

161
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:50,320
Our tour has officially begun!

162
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:52,720
Though our time together is short,

163
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,799
lasting just one day,

164
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,799
as the old saying goes:

165
00:10:55,799 --> 00:10:57,919
"Fate brings people together from afar."

166
00:10:58,399 --> 00:10:59,480
A tour guide...

167
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:01,120
talking up a storm,

168
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:03,440
yet not pitching any overpriced goods.

169
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:04,840
It's just a day tour.

170
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:07,000
There are definitely no hotel commissions,

171
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:09,480
and probably no restaurant kickbacks either.

172
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,799
Everyone brought their own bread and dry rations.

173
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:14,039
If there's no markup on admission tickets either...

174
00:11:14,639 --> 00:11:15,440
Here's a puzzle for you:

175
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:18,759
how do they even make any money?

176
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,639
If there's no profit to be made,

177
00:11:23,639 --> 00:11:24,519
nobody would bother doing it.

178
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,039
The more concealed it is,

179
00:11:27,039 --> 00:11:28,120
the more lucrative it gets.

180
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,039
Xiao Lu told me that.

181
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:03,840
How have things been lately?

182
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:04,879
Everything's been great.

183
00:12:04,879 --> 00:12:06,039
Same medicine as last time?

184
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:06,679
Yes.

185
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,240
I'm heading out.

186
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:14,720
All right.

187
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:20,360
Something wrong?

188
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:21,720
Just having a look.

189
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,240
People who come to me...

190
00:13:24,759 --> 00:13:25,519
...find it hard to speak up.

191
00:13:25,799 --> 00:13:27,159
If it's hard to say, how should I put it?

192
00:13:27,679 --> 00:13:29,080
They're afraid to face their illness.

193
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,000
Go ahead, tell me.

194
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,159
We want a baby.

195
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,320
How many years has it been?

196
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:36,720
Up ahead, we'll soon arrive at...

197
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:39,120
...the largest Guandi Temple in Ronghai.

198
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:41,200
Follow me, everyone. Keep moving forward.

199
00:13:41,799 --> 00:13:42,720
This way.

200
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,360
Tour guide, wait a moment.

201
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,440
Let me look at this necklace.

202
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:46,679
Can we take five minutes?

203
00:13:46,879 --> 00:13:47,759
Sure, no problem.

204
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,960
This necklace is gorgeous.

205
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:50,960
Come take a look, come see!

206
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:51,919
This coral necklace...

207
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,200
When we travel...

208
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,679
...we should pick something unique.

209
00:13:54,679 --> 00:13:55,240
Don't you agree?

210
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:58,720
Ma'am.

211
00:13:58,879 --> 00:13:59,879
This one's really pretty.

212
00:13:59,879 --> 00:14:01,759
The woman who complained we were noisy earlier...

213
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:02,759
...she's a shill.

214
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:03,679
Good for them.

215
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,200
I don't mind them making money.

216
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,480
Just afraid they'd be working for free.

217
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,639
All right, if you're done, follow me forward.

218
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:09,960
Okay, let's go, let's go.

219
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:11,440
Keep moving toward Guandi Temple.

220
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:13,159
Now, everyone...

221
00:14:13,159 --> 00:14:14,960
...this little bazaar we're in...

222
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:17,480
...is a specialty of the local village.

223
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:19,519
If you like something, take one home.

224
00:14:19,519 --> 00:14:20,919
They're all handmade.

225
00:14:20,919 --> 00:14:22,159
Those in the back, follow me further in.

226
00:14:22,159 --> 00:14:23,279
Once we reach the very end...

227
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:24,639
...the view is the best.

228
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:26,840
And to our northwest...

229
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:29,519
...towards the north, is the Taiwan Strait.

230
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:32,000
You can all take souvenir photos here.

231
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:36,639
Thank you, guide.

232
00:14:36,639 --> 00:14:37,240
Thank you!

233
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:37,799
No problem.

234
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:41,240
Blessed fruit.

235
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,840
A volunteer at Guandi Temple gave it to me.

236
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:45,559
Here, have one.

237
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:46,879
Thank you, Boss Lin.

238
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:47,879
Good luck and great fortune!

239
00:14:49,519 --> 00:14:52,000
I remember there's a Lingfeng Pagoda around here.

240
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:53,639
Is it over that way?

241
00:14:55,279 --> 00:14:56,360
To the northwest?

242
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:57,720
I don't think so.

243
00:15:00,799 --> 00:15:02,639
Are you talking about the one near Tongshan?

244
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,559
No way.

245
00:15:03,559 --> 00:15:04,200
There definitely is one.

246
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,240
I couldn't be mistaken.

247
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,320
A relative of mine climbed it before.

248
00:15:11,039 --> 00:15:11,759
Tour guide!

249
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,440
When are we gathering?

250
00:15:15,159 --> 00:15:16,799
We head back in three minutes.

251
00:15:16,919 --> 00:15:17,480
Got it.

252
00:15:18,679 --> 00:15:19,799
What did you just say?

253
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,600
Invoices. How do we get invoices for the two of us?

254
00:15:27,519 --> 00:15:28,960
You Taiwanese businessmen need invoices, too?

255
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,039
Where do you expense them?

256
00:15:30,039 --> 00:15:31,440
With my company, of course.

257
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,919
We need legitimate tax deductions.

258
00:15:32,919 --> 00:15:33,960
My business is based on the mainland now.

259
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,840
Didn't you know?

260
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,639
The wind's too strong. Let's go.

261
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,080
There's another blessed fruit, eat it up.

262
00:15:48,519 --> 00:15:49,399
You have it.

263
00:15:49,399 --> 00:15:50,360
It brings peace and safety.

264
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:20,919
Brother Qi! Brother Qi!

265
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:21,960
I've checked it out.

266
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:23,720
Cao Liaoping has always had a habit of morning runs,

267
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,559
for at least 20 years.

268
00:16:24,559 --> 00:16:26,440
But he used to run by the City Sports Bureau,

269
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,639
or near his workplace.

270
00:16:27,879 --> 00:16:29,000
He only switched to People's Park recently.

271
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:31,799
Something's off.

272
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,759
What's off? Cao Liaoping?

273
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,120
No.

274
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,440
Brother Qi, why'd you hit me?

275
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,240
Sneaking around cheating,

276
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,440
cuckolding another man,

277
00:16:46,639 --> 00:16:47,840
and getting cornered at the door—

278
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:49,480
could anyone really be in such high spirits?

279
00:16:51,759 --> 00:16:53,519
If someone slept with your girlfriend

280
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:54,960
and kicked you out of the house,

281
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,720
you might let it slide, but what about Huadong?

282
00:16:57,759 --> 00:16:59,639
You stole a girl from a proud man like him.

283
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:00,879
What would he do to you?

284
00:17:02,559 --> 00:17:03,320
Kill me.

285
00:17:05,039 --> 00:17:05,599
All right.

286
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:07,240
Go see your lover

287
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,920
and that meticulous neighbor of hers.

288
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:10,880
Thank you.

289
00:17:15,039 --> 00:17:16,359
Board the bus this way.

290
00:17:16,359 --> 00:17:17,720
Shenzhou Strait Travel Agency!

291
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:18,400
Let's take a photo right here.

292
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,720
Red Caps, over here!

293
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:21,559
Watch your bags!

294
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:30,039
Whether you're gathering intelligence

295
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,680
or conducting surveillance,

296
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:33,400
the single most important quality

297
00:17:34,119 --> 00:17:36,720
is to never leave a trace anywhere.

298
00:17:38,119 --> 00:17:39,759
Let's go, let's go. Get on the bus.

299
00:17:40,799 --> 00:17:42,440
Keep hold of your bags.

300
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:51,559
Watch your personal belongings!

301
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:52,960
Check your bags, everyone!

302
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,759
Board the bus in order with your group.

303
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,960
Watch your bag, sir!

304
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,799
Find an empty seat and sit down.

305
00:18:18,759 --> 00:18:19,680
I wasn't asleep.

306
00:18:20,319 --> 00:18:23,200
My eyes were just tired.

307
00:18:26,599 --> 00:18:28,039
I didn't bring you along to stand guard.

308
00:18:28,319 --> 00:18:29,559
Sleep if you want to.

309
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:31,599
Well,

310
00:18:32,079 --> 00:18:33,720
Boss, just call me if you need anything.

311
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,000
I'm a light sleeper.

312
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,119
You've lived with your aunt so long,

313
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,039
why didn't you enlist?

314
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,559
If my aunt were a tour guide,

315
00:18:43,559 --> 00:18:45,319
would I have had to become a driver?

316
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:53,519
When you get the chance,

317
00:18:54,519 --> 00:18:55,920
invite your aunt out

318
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:56,960
for a meal.

319
00:18:58,079 --> 00:18:59,079
I've got a friend

320
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,039
who wants to deal in military supplies.

321
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,559
Then I'd act as the guide too,

322
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:04,359
just making the introductions.

323
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:08,759
Boss,

324
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:11,680
if I can't pull it off

325
00:19:12,279 --> 00:19:13,640
and can't set up the meal,

326
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,640
are you going to fire me?

327
00:19:18,519 --> 00:19:19,640
You're a smart guy.

328
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,519
As long as you don't fire me.

329
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,799
Wake me when we get there.

330
00:19:57,079 --> 00:19:57,960
We've reached the service area.

331
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,799
Use the restroom if you need to.

332
00:20:00,039 --> 00:20:00,920
Let's take a breather.

333
00:20:01,119 --> 00:20:02,680
We'll head out in ten minutes.

334
00:20:04,039 --> 00:20:04,680
Wait, wait!

335
00:20:04,799 --> 00:20:05,640
Everyone, wait a second!

336
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:06,599
My wallet is gone!

337
00:20:06,759 --> 00:20:07,640
Nobody get off yet!

338
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:09,799
Ma'am, I really need the bathroom.

339
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,480
Quiet, everyone!

340
00:20:12,559 --> 00:20:13,960
Let's hear her out first, okay?

341
00:20:14,039 --> 00:20:15,680
When did you lose your wallet?

342
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:16,960
Where did it happen?

343
00:20:17,279 --> 00:20:18,960
I still had it when buying the coral necklace.

344
00:20:19,519 --> 00:20:20,599
I just felt for it, and it was gone.

345
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:21,960
There must be a thief on this bus!

346
00:20:22,079 --> 00:20:22,720
Who are you talking about?

347
00:20:23,119 --> 00:20:23,839
Who are you calling a thief?

348
00:20:23,839 --> 00:20:24,880
Nobody gets off!

349
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:25,759
I'm checking everyone!

350
00:20:26,039 --> 00:20:26,680
I'm searching everyone!

351
00:20:26,799 --> 00:20:27,519
No one is leaving!

352
00:20:27,519 --> 00:20:29,079
Who are you calling a thief, huh?

353
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,200
Wait a second.

354
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,039
Just wait a second.

355
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,799
Just hold it in a bit, it won't take long.

356
00:20:35,039 --> 00:20:36,720
Let me sort this out, alright?

357
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:37,480
Go ahead, ma'am.

358
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:39,039
Isn't she your neighbor?

359
00:20:39,359 --> 00:20:40,799
Shouldn't we speak up for her?

360
00:20:40,799 --> 00:20:41,720
Was it in your bag or on you?

361
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:42,759
On me.

362
00:20:42,960 --> 00:20:44,279
This detail is very important.

363
00:20:44,559 --> 00:20:45,519
The necklace was in your bag.

364
00:20:45,599 --> 00:20:46,559
The wallet was on you.

365
00:20:46,599 --> 00:20:48,160
Your attention was on the necklace.

366
00:20:48,359 --> 00:20:50,000
If someone swiped your wallet,

367
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,200
you wouldn't have noticed.

368
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:51,480
Right.

369
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:51,920
That's true.

370
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:52,559
Exactly.

371
00:20:52,559 --> 00:20:53,680
Who's to say that's what happened?

372
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,240
Okay, let's look at after boarding.

373
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:56,319
The seat you're sitting in.

374
00:20:56,599 --> 00:20:57,519
I'm in front of you.

375
00:20:57,519 --> 00:20:58,400
You can see me.

376
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:59,359
To your left is the aisle.

377
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:01,519
If someone behind tried to steal it,

378
00:21:01,519 --> 00:21:02,279
you'd be able to see them too.

379
00:21:02,279 --> 00:21:04,000
There's no gap between the seats.

380
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,640
Reaching a hand through is impossible.

381
00:21:05,799 --> 00:21:07,720
Only the person on your right could have stolen it.

382
00:21:08,039 --> 00:21:08,559
That's true.

383
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:10,720
The one on my right is my sister.

384
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,559
Why would she steal my wallet?

385
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:15,000
That rules out it being stolen on the bus.

386
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:15,720
So...

387
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:17,119
can we assume that

388
00:21:17,279 --> 00:21:18,839
the only place it was stolen,

389
00:21:18,839 --> 00:21:20,359
the most likely place,

390
00:21:20,359 --> 00:21:21,599
had to be where the necklaces were sold?

391
00:21:21,759 --> 00:21:22,559
Right, right.

392
00:21:22,559 --> 00:21:23,319
Exactly.

393
00:21:23,319 --> 00:21:24,880
Impressive deduction skills.

394
00:21:25,519 --> 00:21:26,720
He doesn't act like a tour guide at all.

395
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:28,039
What does he act like then?

396
00:21:28,559 --> 00:21:29,799
Either a cop,

397
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:31,880
or a judge.

398
00:21:33,319 --> 00:21:34,559
Or...

399
00:21:41,519 --> 00:21:42,519
Looks like a reporter.

400
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:47,000
Actually, she didn't know

401
00:21:47,319 --> 00:21:48,559
where she lost her wallet.

402
00:21:49,119 --> 00:21:50,759
As long as it wasn't lost on the bus.

403
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:53,000
As long as her bonus isn't docked.

404
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:59,480
Well, that's all for today's meeting.

405
00:21:59,759 --> 00:22:00,839
The few of you, stay behind.

406
00:22:01,039 --> 00:22:04,200
Go over the proposal thoroughly with Engineer Cao.

407
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,920
Take care, President Jiao.

408
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:11,880
Professor Cao.

409
00:22:12,079 --> 00:22:13,400
Drinking coffee this late?

410
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:14,200
Can you even sleep?

411
00:22:14,359 --> 00:22:16,000
Drinking this coffee helps me sleep soundly.

412
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:16,839
Try some.

413
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:17,680
Not for me.

414
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,559
Isn't this just Chinese herbal medicine?

415
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:21,559
It nourishes the body.

416
00:22:21,839 --> 00:22:22,759
Have a taste.

417
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:24,799
If we keep working late like this,

418
00:22:24,799 --> 00:22:26,599
we'll be drinking it with you by next year.

419
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:29,240
I'll save the prescription for you all.

420
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,960
So you can take it when you get older.

421
00:22:31,119 --> 00:22:31,480
All right.

422
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,000
Sounds good.

423
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:33,559
Thanks, Engineer Cao. Thank you.

424
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:35,880
You guys are so young.

425
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:38,319
Don't tell me you just go home and sleep?

426
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:39,039
What else would we do?

427
00:22:39,039 --> 00:22:40,079
Sleep is all there is.

428
00:22:40,079 --> 00:22:41,200
Don't you have any nightlife?

429
00:22:41,759 --> 00:22:42,640
What nightlife?

430
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,759
Ever been to a nightclub?

431
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:44,759
No.

432
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:45,880
Never.

433
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:47,079
None of you?

434
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:48,359
Never been.

435
00:22:48,640 --> 00:22:49,039
All right!

436
00:22:50,599 --> 00:22:52,079
I'll splurge today.

437
00:22:52,079 --> 00:22:54,359
I'll pay out of pocket to take everyone to a nightclub!

438
00:22:54,359 --> 00:22:54,839
Let's go!

439
00:22:54,839 --> 00:22:56,319
Check your belongings.

440
00:22:56,319 --> 00:22:57,640
Grab all your personal items.

441
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:10,920
Are you heading back to the travel agency?

442
00:23:11,039 --> 00:23:12,000
How about I give you a ride?

443
00:23:13,599 --> 00:23:15,640
I settled everything with your secretary last time.

444
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:17,000
We get a discount without an invoice.

445
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:19,079
We agreed we could just board on the day.

446
00:23:19,079 --> 00:23:20,599
But you showed up out of nowhere today,

447
00:23:20,599 --> 00:23:21,680
so it's hard for me to arrange things.

448
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,799
And as for whether you get an invoice,

449
00:23:23,799 --> 00:23:25,119
don't ask about that in front of my coworker.

450
00:23:25,279 --> 00:23:26,279
Which one's your coworker?

451
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,200
Boss Lin.

452
00:23:38,599 --> 00:23:39,680
What happened to your face?

453
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,000
Got bitten by a mad dog.

454
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,039
When?

455
00:23:42,039 --> 00:23:44,039
Does a mad dog care what time it is?

456
00:23:44,039 --> 00:23:45,160
It just bites whenever it catches you.

457
00:23:48,319 --> 00:23:50,079
Are you here to pick me up or the pretty lady?

458
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:51,559
I'll drop her off first.

459
00:23:51,559 --> 00:23:52,680
Didn't Brother Qi tell you?

460
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:54,880
About meeting the health bureau chief tonight to approve files?

461
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:55,839
Didn't he call you?

462
00:23:55,839 --> 00:23:56,720
He did.

463
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,839
I told him we'd meet straight at Pacific Nightclub.

464
00:23:58,839 --> 00:23:59,799
We can get dinner there too.

465
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:01,680
Saves us the trouble of running around.

466
00:24:01,799 --> 00:24:02,559
Whatever you say.

467
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:08,000
Professor Cao is going to Pacific Nightclub,

468
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,240
and your neighbor also suggested

469
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,880
meeting the health bureau chief there.

470
00:24:11,039 --> 00:24:12,680
Do you think that's a coincidence?

471
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:18,079
Seeing that I know Brother Xiao,

472
00:24:18,079 --> 00:24:19,000
and that we're so close,

473
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,240
you're not surprised at all.

474
00:24:25,559 --> 00:24:26,559
Living next door to you,

475
00:24:26,799 --> 00:24:28,599
I don't know any of your secrets.

476
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:31,000
Boss, sorry I'm late.

477
00:24:31,559 --> 00:24:32,759
Drop her off at home.

478
00:24:32,759 --> 00:24:34,079
Can I catch a ride with you guys?

479
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:34,920
No problem.

480
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:36,279
Boss, I'll be on my way then.

481
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:36,960
Bye-bye.

482
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:38,119
Does it hurt?

483
00:24:38,359 --> 00:24:38,960
I'm fine.

484
00:24:39,279 --> 00:24:40,880
I'll just get a popsicle to ice it later.

485
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:41,759
He got it way worse.

486
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:42,920
Just bam, bam, bam!

487
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:44,359
His eye was swollen shut.

488
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:47,920
Thirty percent is destiny,

489
00:24:48,319 --> 00:24:50,680
seventy percent hard work.

490
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:55,359
Fight to Win!

491
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:59,839
Tell me, isn't it a small world?

492
00:25:00,279 --> 00:25:01,880
Ronghai is 300 km from Taiwan, China,

493
00:25:02,039 --> 00:25:03,799
with such a wide sea in between.

494
00:25:04,319 --> 00:25:05,880
I crossed the sea to come here,

495
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:07,559
and somehow ended up in a car

496
00:25:07,559 --> 00:25:08,759
with you two lovebirds.

497
00:25:09,119 --> 00:25:10,319
In such a huge city,

498
00:25:10,519 --> 00:25:11,920
Brother Xiao is my partner,

499
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:14,079
and Sister Lan is my neighbor.

500
00:25:14,400 --> 00:25:16,400
No one would believe it if you told them, right?

501
00:25:16,799 --> 00:25:18,640
Don't just keep all the happiness to yourselves.

502
00:25:18,839 --> 00:25:20,640
When are you going to set me up with a girlfriend?

503
00:25:20,799 --> 00:25:22,400
Being far away from home,

504
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:24,240
I need something to make me stay.

505
00:25:24,519 --> 00:25:26,480
You go to nightclubs every single day,

506
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:27,599
why would you need me to set you up?

507
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:29,119
I'm just a driver.

508
00:25:29,319 --> 00:25:30,559
I'm not allowed inside.

509
00:25:30,559 --> 00:25:31,559
I can only wait at the door.

510
00:25:31,839 --> 00:25:33,039
If you don't believe me, ask Boss Lin.

511
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:36,319
He's not just a driver.

512
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,920
He's a tour guide!

513
00:25:38,119 --> 00:25:39,000
Every nightclub in the city,

514
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:40,319
he took us to all of them.

515
00:25:40,480 --> 00:25:41,640
Didn't miss a single one.

516
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:43,319
Since you're so good at it,

517
00:25:43,759 --> 00:25:45,319
you should work as a guide with us.

518
00:25:45,559 --> 00:25:47,640
Next time I get a question I can't answer,

519
00:25:47,640 --> 00:25:49,000
you could help me out.

520
00:25:49,160 --> 00:25:49,880
What kind of question?

521
00:25:50,279 --> 00:25:51,799
Lingfeng Pagoda. Have you heard of it?

522
00:25:52,119 --> 00:25:53,079
What Lingfeng Pagoda?

523
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:54,200
Never heard of it.

524
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,440
I've only heard of Leifeng Pagoda.

525
00:25:58,480 --> 00:25:59,880
It's Wenfeng Pagoda!

526
00:26:00,079 --> 00:26:01,680
There's no Lingfeng Pagoda.

527
00:26:01,839 --> 00:26:02,960
I must've remembered it wrong.

528
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:04,319
I totally fooled you too.

529
00:26:04,519 --> 00:26:06,319
I was wondering why I'd never heard of it.

530
00:26:06,559 --> 00:26:08,119
I thought a new attraction had opened

531
00:26:08,119 --> 00:26:09,319
so we could charge more.

532
00:26:10,279 --> 00:26:11,720
Tourists just love this sort of thing,

533
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:13,039
anything that sounds like a good bargain.

534
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:15,279
Like Wind-rocking Stone and Wenfeng Pagoda.

535
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,880
Group them together, it's one stop.

536
00:26:17,039 --> 00:26:18,599
List them separately, and it's two stops.

537
00:26:18,799 --> 00:26:19,759
Buy one, get one free!

538
00:26:19,759 --> 00:26:20,880
People love the sound of that.

539
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:21,839
Brother,

540
00:26:22,599 --> 00:26:23,720
you're a lucky man.

541
00:26:24,480 --> 00:26:26,119
How did you find a girlfriend so pretty,

542
00:26:26,119 --> 00:26:28,480
so capable, and so smart?

543
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:30,559
Seriously, forget about being a tour guide.

544
00:26:30,559 --> 00:26:32,480
Just come lead the three of us

545
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,319
and deal in CT scanners

546
00:26:33,319 --> 00:26:34,200
and MRIs with us!

547
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:35,400
No way. Sounds good!

548
00:26:40,839 --> 00:26:42,200
I haven't even negotiated terms yet,

549
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,640
and you've already shut the door.

550
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:45,480
What if Boss Lin is willing to shell out the money?

551
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:46,559
Hold on.

552
00:26:46,559 --> 00:26:48,319
Just last night at home you said

553
00:26:48,359 --> 00:26:51,160
you'd open some travel agency on your own,

554
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,119
and today you've already changed your mind?

555
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:01,440
That Lin Kanshan...

556
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:03,079
He's such an easy mark.

557
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:05,799
That one-day tour looks cheap,

558
00:27:05,799 --> 00:27:08,559
but worse than the 5-day in-depth tour.

559
00:27:08,559 --> 00:27:10,400
It's full of tourist traps all the way.

560
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:11,759
Good thing I was there.

561
00:27:11,759 --> 00:27:12,960
If it weren't for me,

562
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:14,920
who knows how badly he would've been ripped off.

563
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:18,480
You think he might have a thing for that tour guide,

564
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,680
chasing after her like that?

565
00:27:19,839 --> 00:27:20,480
No way.

566
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:21,599
She has a boyfriend.

567
00:27:21,839 --> 00:27:22,720
Didn't you know?

568
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:25,000
Guys got jealous and fought over her before,

569
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,039
beating each other black and blue.

570
00:27:26,039 --> 00:27:27,400
How do you adjust this seat?

571
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,200
On your right.

572
00:27:32,279 --> 00:27:33,599
Don't laugh at me.

573
00:27:34,039 --> 00:27:34,599
By the way,

574
00:27:35,799 --> 00:27:37,079
why did you

575
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:39,599
and Lin Kanshan get beaten up back then?

576
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,880
Was it over the nightclub hostesses?

577
00:27:42,119 --> 00:27:43,400
Two guys fighting over one girl, right?

578
00:27:43,640 --> 00:27:44,799
No, it wasn't.

579
00:27:44,799 --> 00:27:46,720
The boss got drunk and picked a fight,

580
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:47,839
so of course I had to back him up.

581
00:27:47,839 --> 00:27:49,000
Otherwise, why would he pay me?

582
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:50,039
It was definitely over a woman.

583
00:27:50,279 --> 00:27:51,359
It was just the booze.

584
00:27:51,599 --> 00:27:53,319
Those girls are just nightclub hostesses

585
00:27:53,319 --> 00:27:54,559
looking to make tips.

586
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,440
Just factory girls from around here.

587
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:57,839
Why would they ever fall for me?

588
00:27:58,200 --> 00:27:59,359
Factory girls?

589
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:02,000
How could factory girls work here?

590
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,039
It pays a lot.

591
00:28:03,279 --> 00:28:04,880
Once men drink too much,

592
00:28:04,880 --> 00:28:05,920
they lose all sense of money.

593
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:07,559
They throw tips around like scrap paper.

594
00:28:07,799 --> 00:28:10,599
I thought they only made a flat wage.

595
00:28:10,759 --> 00:28:12,839
Waiters like me are the ones on a flat wage.

596
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,640
Glad I became a driver instead.

597
00:28:14,640 --> 00:28:16,400
Otherwise I'd still be smelling piss and shit in the restroom.

598
00:28:17,359 --> 00:28:20,759
What about the money for the camera you and Xiao Jiang broke?

599
00:28:20,759 --> 00:28:21,920
Did you scrape it all together yet?

600
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:24,640
I'll have enough once I get paid.

601
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:37,000
Oh no, it's almost eight.

602
00:28:37,319 --> 00:28:37,960
What's wrong?

603
00:28:39,039 --> 00:28:40,039
Nothing.

604
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:42,759
Why don't you just drop me off up ahead?

605
00:28:43,079 --> 00:28:43,880
Aren't you going back to school?

606
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:44,599
We're not there yet.

607
00:28:45,119 --> 00:28:46,759
School's been really strict lately.

608
00:28:46,759 --> 00:28:48,200
I didn't even ask for leave.

609
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:50,559
Riding back in this Crown every day...

610
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:52,400
You think I'm not conspicuous enough already?

611
00:28:59,200 --> 00:28:59,920
Bye.

612
00:29:14,480 --> 00:29:16,000
Welcome.

613
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:19,799
Welcome to Pacific Nightclub.

614
00:29:23,799 --> 00:29:27,160
Welcome to Pacific Nightclub.

615
00:29:30,319 --> 00:29:33,039
Good evening, gentlemen.

616
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:34,799
Is this really appropriate?

617
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:36,759
What's wrong with it?

618
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:42,839
Let's go.

619
00:29:51,599 --> 00:29:52,200
Young man,

620
00:29:52,720 --> 00:29:55,519
show us to Room 888 in a bit.

621
00:29:55,519 --> 00:29:55,880
Sure thing.

622
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:57,480
Come on, is everything checked in?

623
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:58,759
Let this young man lead the way.

624
00:29:58,839 --> 00:29:59,359
You go ahead.

625
00:29:59,359 --> 00:29:59,759
I'll be right there.

626
00:29:59,759 --> 00:30:00,759
I'll join you once I check my bag.

627
00:30:00,759 --> 00:30:01,119
Alright.

628
00:30:36,799 --> 00:30:37,720
Hello, Sister Xia.

629
00:30:41,680 --> 00:30:42,200
Sister Xia.

630
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:02,160
Take care, Sis.

631
00:31:05,839 --> 00:31:06,680
Chief Liao.

632
00:31:06,680 --> 00:31:08,160
A busy man like you,

633
00:31:08,160 --> 00:31:09,880
calling to check in on things?

634
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:11,440
Talk about VIP treatment!

635
00:31:12,759 --> 00:31:13,680
It's a misunderstanding.

636
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:15,279
A total misunderstanding.

637
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:17,200
It's already been cleared up.

638
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:18,240
That's right.

639
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:20,799
The responding officers already headed back.

640
00:31:21,200 --> 00:31:21,759
Everything's fine now.

641
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:23,559
Yeah.

642
00:31:23,559 --> 00:31:25,119
Come on over when you're free.

643
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:26,640
Sure, let's catch up soon.

644
00:31:32,559 --> 00:31:33,640
I'm right at the scene.

645
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:34,680
We're here to make an arrest.

646
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:36,559
An arrest? Who are you arresting?

647
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:38,039
Cops! Fall back!

648
00:31:49,519 --> 00:31:50,680
Director Lin is here.

649
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:52,240
Director Lin, right this way.

650
00:31:52,799 --> 00:31:53,799
This way, please. Come on in.

651
00:31:53,799 --> 00:31:54,400
Director Lin.

652
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:55,319
We're all good brothers here.

653
00:31:56,440 --> 00:31:56,759
Sit down, please. Take a seat.

654
00:31:56,759 --> 00:31:57,119
Hello, Director.

655
00:31:57,119 --> 00:31:58,640
Director Lin, please have a seat.

656
00:31:58,759 --> 00:31:59,400
Make yourselves at home.

657
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:01,880
Without weathering the storm,

658
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:04,519
how can you see a rainbow?

659
00:32:04,519 --> 00:32:09,079
No one achieves success easily.

660
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:14,680
Cherish every moving moment in life,

661
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:19,240
and warmly embrace the friends you love.

662
00:32:20,079 --> 00:32:22,400
When you say discomfort, is it pain,

663
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:23,279
a feeling of tightness,

664
00:32:23,279 --> 00:32:24,160
shortness of breath,

665
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:25,119
or something else?

666
00:32:25,119 --> 00:32:26,559
Right here around my heart,

667
00:32:26,759 --> 00:32:28,839
sometimes it feels tight,

668
00:32:28,839 --> 00:32:30,480
mostly at night.

669
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,319
Looking at your ECG,

670
00:32:32,319 --> 00:32:33,440
it appears normal right now.

671
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:37,680
Okay.

672
00:32:37,920 --> 00:32:38,599
Thank you, Doctor.

673
00:32:44,839 --> 00:32:46,279
Hi, I'm here to pay.

674
00:32:48,039 --> 00:32:49,480
I'm a student.

675
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:51,039
Can I get half price?

676
00:32:59,079 --> 00:32:59,680
Excuse me.

677
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:00,359
Excuse me,

678
00:33:00,359 --> 00:33:01,319
you took the wrong one.

679
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,400
This is my student ID.

680
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,079
Jin Lina.

681
00:33:03,359 --> 00:33:04,920
Ganzhou Teachers College English major.

682
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:06,720
Took the adult college exam 2.5 years ago,

683
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:08,720
and scraped into the languages department.

684
00:33:09,039 --> 00:33:10,039
Native of Sichuan.

685
00:33:10,039 --> 00:33:11,720
Wrote for foreign-language magazines

686
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:12,839
under the pen name Autumn.

687
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,279
Am I right?

688
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:16,000
Who are you?

689
00:33:20,079 --> 00:33:21,119
There's a matter

690
00:33:21,119 --> 00:33:22,279
that requires your cooperation in an investigation.

691
00:33:22,279 --> 00:33:23,680
Who the hell are you?

692
00:33:32,119 --> 00:33:32,880
Call me.

693
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:41,119
Keep this confidential.

694
00:33:45,799 --> 00:33:46,440
Then...

695
00:33:46,759 --> 00:33:48,119
where do I go?

696
00:33:48,759 --> 00:33:49,839
What's the investigation about?

697
00:33:49,839 --> 00:33:50,839
Wait for my call.

698
00:33:58,079 --> 00:33:59,200
I've been eating well, too.

699
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:01,920
School lunch was great today, I really liked it.

700
00:34:03,559 --> 00:34:04,839
I'll let you go now, Mom.

701
00:34:05,119 --> 00:34:05,720
Bye-bye.

702
00:34:22,559 --> 00:34:24,480
Provincial Military District Guard Office, hello.

703
00:34:25,679 --> 00:34:26,400
Hello.

704
00:34:26,519 --> 00:34:27,320
Hello.

705
00:34:28,119 --> 00:34:30,079
I'm looking for someone.

706
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:31,440
Someone in your unit.

707
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:33,320
Which department? What's their name?

708
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:36,199
Speak up.

709
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:37,119
I forgot.

710
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:43,800
Wait for me a second.

711
00:34:43,800 --> 00:34:45,519
In my heart,

712
00:34:46,039 --> 00:34:48,280
there was once a dream,

713
00:34:48,559 --> 00:34:52,599
to heal all the pain with a song.

714
00:34:53,719 --> 00:34:55,079
How does the next line go?

715
00:34:55,840 --> 00:34:57,199
Who is the true hero?

716
00:34:57,639 --> 00:34:59,679
Who, who is the true hero?

717
00:35:00,119 --> 00:35:03,280
Engineer Cao, of course! He's the true hero!

718
00:35:04,559 --> 00:35:05,719
Take it easy, watch your step.

719
00:35:08,239 --> 00:35:09,480
Careful, Director Lin.

720
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:11,840
Easy, easy, easy.

721
00:35:12,440 --> 00:35:14,880
Honestly, you can really hold your liquor.

722
00:35:15,679 --> 00:35:16,480
Not anymore.

723
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:17,559
I'm getting old now.

724
00:35:17,559 --> 00:35:18,639
Let's do this again another day, all right?

725
00:35:18,639 --> 00:35:20,079
Engineer Cao, you really opened our eyes today.

726
00:35:20,079 --> 00:35:22,559
Starting today, the two of us will head home together.

727
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:24,360
What's going on here?

728
00:35:24,599 --> 00:35:26,280
Don't meddle in young people's business.

729
00:35:28,199 --> 00:35:28,840
All right, all right.

730
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:29,719
We're off, we're off.

731
00:35:30,119 --> 00:35:30,880
Take it easy, slow down.

732
00:35:31,199 --> 00:35:32,679
Director, goodbye!

733
00:35:34,119 --> 00:35:35,159
Drinks again another day!

734
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:40,320
All right, Brother Qi.

735
00:35:40,599 --> 00:35:41,719
We're heading back now.

736
00:35:41,719 --> 00:35:43,119
Watch yourselves on the way.

737
00:35:43,119 --> 00:35:44,119
Don't get ambushed out there,

738
00:35:44,119 --> 00:35:45,360
or you'll take another punch to the face.

739
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:46,920
Don't worry, I've got his back.

740
00:35:47,519 --> 00:35:48,360
We're off.

741
00:35:50,599 --> 00:35:51,400
Welcome!

742
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:54,000
Welcome to Pacific Nightclub.

743
00:35:56,519 --> 00:35:57,440
Welcome!

744
00:35:58,239 --> 00:36:00,679
Welcome to Pacific Nightclub.

745
00:36:03,519 --> 00:36:04,559
Welcome!

746
00:36:05,280 --> 00:36:06,480
What's the situation on your end?

747
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:07,519
If I were Lin,

748
00:36:07,960 --> 00:36:09,880
and a bunch of researchers passed by,

749
00:36:10,119 --> 00:36:11,079
chattering away,

750
00:36:11,239 --> 00:36:12,880
talking about interesting things,

751
00:36:12,880 --> 00:36:13,559
Taxi!

752
00:36:13,559 --> 00:36:15,079
no matter how uninterested I was,

753
00:36:15,079 --> 00:36:16,400
I'd still turn my head and look.

754
00:36:17,079 --> 00:36:17,960
But he didn't.

755
00:36:18,559 --> 00:36:19,559
What about Cao Liaoping?

756
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:20,679
How did he react?

757
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:21,679
Just like Lin.

758
00:36:22,079 --> 00:36:23,079
Completely preoccupied.

759
00:36:24,039 --> 00:36:25,440
This is getting more and more interesting.

760
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:30,039
What's going on up ahead?

761
00:36:30,039 --> 00:36:31,079
Why aren't we moving?

762
00:36:32,719 --> 00:36:33,920
What are the traffic cops doing?

763
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:37,679
Are they checking for drunk drivers up ahead?

764
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:39,480
You barely see that twice a year.

765
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:41,280
It must be a crackdown this time.

766
00:36:41,519 --> 00:36:42,360
Don't worry.

767
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:43,480
Call your brother-in-law.

768
00:36:44,039 --> 00:36:44,440
Boss Lin.

769
00:36:44,679 --> 00:36:45,719
Roll up the windows.

770
00:36:46,079 --> 00:36:47,360
Whatever happens, do not get out of the car.

771
00:36:52,239 --> 00:36:53,519
Deserting at the first sign of trouble?

772
00:36:54,239 --> 00:36:55,760
Relax, nobody killed anyone.

773
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:56,880
What's there to be afraid of?

774
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:57,719
Next car, please.

775
00:36:58,920 --> 00:36:59,760
Next car!

776
00:37:05,039 --> 00:37:05,639
Get out of the car.

777
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:08,159
Show me your ID and driver's license.

778
00:37:08,519 --> 00:37:09,159
Get out!

779
00:37:09,880 --> 00:37:10,559
You get out too.

780
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,039
Get out of the car.

781
00:37:13,079 --> 00:37:13,599
Get out!

782
00:37:14,239 --> 00:37:14,760
ID and driver's license.

783
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:15,480
Stop flashing that!

784
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:17,039
How much have you had to drink?

785
00:37:17,039 --> 00:37:17,599
Brother Qi.

786
00:37:17,599 --> 00:37:19,639
Lin Kanshan and I ran into a DUI checkpoint.

787
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:20,920
It's that same traffic cop from last time.

788
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,039
Keep shining that and you'll blind me!

789
00:37:22,159 --> 00:37:22,920
On Xuefu Road.

790
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:23,639
What are you doing?

791
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:24,639
Right on Xuefu Road.

792
00:37:25,920 --> 00:37:26,360
Right, right, right.

793
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:27,280
Over here! Everyone, over here!

794
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:28,039
Right on Xuefu Road.

795
00:37:30,119 --> 00:37:30,960
Don't grab me!

796
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:31,599
What are you doing?

797
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:32,239
Get up.

798
00:37:32,239 --> 00:37:32,480
What's going on?

799
00:37:32,480 --> 00:37:33,039
You dare assault a cop?

800
00:37:34,039 --> 00:37:34,599
Assaulting an officer, are you?

801
00:37:34,599 --> 00:37:35,320
Nobody's assaulting anyone!

802
00:37:35,519 --> 00:37:36,360
I didn't even touch him!

803
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:37,639
Think I can't handle you?

804
00:37:37,639 --> 00:37:38,519
Brother, it's you!

805
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:39,800
Wait, brother...

806
00:37:40,320 --> 00:37:41,320
Who's your brother?

807
00:37:41,480 --> 00:37:42,800
Don't pull that crap on me.

808
00:37:43,280 --> 00:37:43,679
Brother...

809
00:37:43,679 --> 00:37:44,800
Why don't you let him go first?

810
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:45,559
He's had too much to drink.

811
00:37:45,559 --> 00:37:46,559
I'm telling you, you're all finished!

812
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,079
Call your Mayor Xie down here!

813
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:49,559
Drink another couple glasses of booze,

814
00:37:49,559 --> 00:37:50,000
and you'll...

815
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,280
you'll claim you even know the governor!

816
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,880
Let him go, let's see what he can do.

817
00:37:53,320 --> 00:37:53,880
Step aside.

818
00:37:54,599 --> 00:37:55,079
Get up.

819
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:56,559
Drank too much.

820
00:37:57,519 --> 00:37:58,519
Had way too much, haven't you?

821
00:37:58,920 --> 00:37:59,559
Yeah.

822
00:37:59,679 --> 00:38:00,320
Don't talk nonsense.

823
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:01,599
We haven't been drinking!

824
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:06,079
Are these plates real or fake this time?

825
00:38:06,960 --> 00:38:07,760
Doesn't matter if they're fake.

826
00:38:08,159 --> 00:38:09,199
We'll handle this by the book.

827
00:38:09,559 --> 00:38:10,840
We're all on the same side anyway.

828
00:38:11,119 --> 00:38:13,679
Tell your leadership to come pick them up later.

829
00:38:15,360 --> 00:38:16,760
Disperse, disperse, move along!

830
00:38:17,039 --> 00:38:18,039
Break it up! Stop watching.

831
00:38:18,039 --> 00:38:19,360
What's there to look at?

832
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:20,400
Brother...

833
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:22,960
Right, we're all on the same side.

834
00:38:22,960 --> 00:38:24,400
We've all served in the army, right?

835
00:38:24,519 --> 00:38:25,800
Come on, it's late at night.

836
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:26,920
You guys have worked hard.

837
00:38:27,159 --> 00:38:28,400
Take this and buy some smokes for the guys.

838
00:38:31,639 --> 00:38:32,920
Have him walk a straight line.

839
00:38:33,760 --> 00:38:36,360
Put that money away in your pocket.

840
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:37,880
If everything checks out,

841
00:38:38,320 --> 00:38:39,239
I'll let you guys go.

842
00:38:45,639 --> 00:38:46,840
Pull the car up ahead.

843
00:38:47,079 --> 00:38:47,840
Don't block the road.

844
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:49,679
You two, come with me.

845
00:38:50,079 --> 00:38:51,079
Up ahead? Move it where?

846
00:38:51,079 --> 00:38:51,760
I'll drive it.

847
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:52,679
Can't drive it now.

848
00:38:52,679 --> 00:38:53,159
Move.

849
00:38:59,239 --> 00:38:59,679
Okay.

850
00:39:00,519 --> 00:39:01,079
Alright.

851
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:03,480
Got it.

852
00:39:07,679 --> 00:39:10,079
Fine, I see you've got connections.

853
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:12,000
Didn't know they were this solid, though.

854
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:13,360
Doesn't matter to me.

855
00:39:13,519 --> 00:39:14,679
Higher-ups told me to let you go,

856
00:39:15,239 --> 00:39:16,199
so I'll let you go.

857
00:39:16,519 --> 00:39:17,280
Thank you, Officer.

858
00:39:17,280 --> 00:39:18,280
Thanks, brother.

859
00:39:18,639 --> 00:39:19,360
Strangers before,

860
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:20,440
friends from now on, right?

861
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:21,239
Let's be friends.

862
00:39:22,519 --> 00:39:23,920
Higher-ups only said to release people,

863
00:39:24,320 --> 00:39:25,519
not the car.

864
00:39:26,079 --> 00:39:28,320
Drive the car to Traffic Police Lot Two.

865
00:39:28,480 --> 00:39:30,320
Hand the keys to Officer Yang in the duty room.

866
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:31,840
They open at eight tomorrow morning.

867
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:33,639
Have your unit do the paperwork to pick it up.

868
00:39:33,639 --> 00:39:35,679
Brother, which unit should go pick it up?

869
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:37,239
In case my buddy gets it wrong.

870
00:39:43,639 --> 00:39:44,280
This car...

871
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:46,079
isn't it from your former unit?

872
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:50,920
Using an official car for personal business...

873
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,719
wouldn't look good out in the open, right?

874
00:39:52,719 --> 00:39:54,760
Your Medical Administration is powerful.

875
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:57,000
You control all the bribe tonics in town.

876
00:39:57,559 --> 00:39:58,480
Why fear something like this?

877
00:39:58,920 --> 00:39:59,440
Captain.

878
00:40:00,159 --> 00:40:00,920
Since when did we...

879
00:40:00,920 --> 00:40:02,760
can't even afford to cross the Medical Bureau?

880
00:40:03,079 --> 00:40:05,280
He's just laid off or went into business.

881
00:40:05,599 --> 00:40:06,679
So should I throw a banquet

882
00:40:06,679 --> 00:40:07,719
and apologize to him?

883
00:40:09,159 --> 00:40:11,719
If the car isn't at the station tonight,

884
00:40:11,719 --> 00:40:13,199
the registration gets revoked.

885
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,920
You nearly twisted my arm off!

886
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,000
Who gives a damn?

887
00:40:16,199 --> 00:40:17,199
I'll take care of it, I will.

888
00:40:17,239 --> 00:40:18,119
Apologize, damn it!

889
00:40:18,280 --> 00:40:19,159
I'm on it, I'm on it!

890
00:40:19,159 --> 00:40:23,920
Life is like the waves upon the sea,

891
00:40:23,920 --> 00:40:29,920
sometimes rising, sometimes falling.

892
00:40:30,079 --> 00:40:31,519
Good luck,

893
00:40:31,519 --> 00:40:32,800
bad luck,

894
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:38,000
you still must do honest work.

895
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:40,760
Thirty percent is fate,

896
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:43,440
seventy percent hard work,

897
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:49,079
Fight to Win!

898
00:40:51,280 --> 00:40:53,360
Before, I could only drop you by the road.

899
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:55,440
Today, I can take you right to your door.

900
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:58,039
I won't worry no matter how much I drink now.

901
00:40:58,599 --> 00:41:00,719
Whether getting an IV drip at midnight,

902
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:02,480
or returning a car to the traffic police,

903
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:03,800
we'll have each other's company from now on.

904
00:41:05,599 --> 00:41:07,000
Never would I have thought

905
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:08,280
the two of us would become neighbors.

906
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,800
Keep quiet and strike it rich.

907
00:41:11,239 --> 00:41:13,360
Only tight-lipped guys like you do big things.

908
00:41:13,599 --> 00:41:15,159
Every time you drove me back before,

909
00:41:15,159 --> 00:41:16,840
you never mentioned your ties next door.

910
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,159
Well,

911
00:41:18,639 --> 00:41:20,599
it's like playing three-card poker.

912
00:41:20,599 --> 00:41:22,199
If you can't hold your hole cards,

913
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:24,559
you get beaten real bad.

914
00:41:26,719 --> 00:41:28,440
If I were half as tight-lipped as you,

915
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:30,360
Director Lin wouldn't distrust me.

916
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:32,719
Relationships between people...

917
00:41:32,719 --> 00:41:34,599
everyone's a stranger at the start.

918
00:41:34,920 --> 00:41:36,079
Just like between you and me.

919
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:38,519
After so much time,

920
00:41:38,519 --> 00:41:40,000
even if you didn't trust each other,

921
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:41,239
don't you have to trust now?

922
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:44,599
I'm off.

923
00:42:09,719 --> 00:42:11,320
How come I've never heard you mention

924
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,719
working at the Medical Admin Bureau?

925
00:42:15,000 --> 00:42:16,960
When did I ever work there?

926
00:42:17,320 --> 00:42:20,480
Brother Qi worked there before going into business.

927
00:42:20,639 --> 00:42:22,480
He almost made division chief.

928
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:24,280
The car is his.

929
00:42:24,280 --> 00:42:25,960
The connections in medicine are his too.

930
00:42:26,159 --> 00:42:27,159
Then why

931
00:42:27,159 --> 00:42:28,159
are we doing CT scanner

932
00:42:28,159 --> 00:42:29,599
and MRI machine leasing?

933
00:42:29,599 --> 00:42:31,559
Why does Director Lin trust us?

934
00:42:32,159 --> 00:42:34,559
Because they and the Medical Bureau...

935
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:36,519
are brother units.

936
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:40,079
Brought him back for you.

937
00:42:40,639 --> 00:42:41,800
Brother units.

938
00:42:42,519 --> 00:42:43,480
You get it?

939
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:46,079
Your brother gets it.

940
00:42:46,079 --> 00:42:47,320
And the unit gets it too.

941
00:42:48,039 --> 00:42:49,800
If that guy who hit you comes back tonight,

942
00:42:49,800 --> 00:42:50,559
bang on the wall.

943
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,079
I'll bring a wrench and take him out.

944
00:42:54,320 --> 00:42:55,159
Get some sleep.

945
00:42:55,440 --> 00:42:55,960
Watch your step.

946
00:42:55,960 --> 00:42:56,599
Drinking so much...

947
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:57,440
Don't work too hard.

948
00:42:57,440 --> 00:42:58,039
Thanks.

949
00:43:08,239 --> 00:43:09,239
I'm Peng Yuchang,

950
00:43:09,239 --> 00:43:10,840
inviting you to watch the TV series,

951
00:43:10,840 --> 00:43:11,679
Confrontation.

952
00:43:11,679 --> 00:43:12,239
President Jiao,

953
00:43:12,400 --> 00:43:13,679
I want to report Cao Liaoping.

954
00:43:13,679 --> 00:43:14,519
I have proof.

955
00:43:15,559 --> 00:43:16,320
Jia Chunlin.

956
00:43:16,320 --> 00:43:16,880
Lao Cao.

957
00:43:17,440 --> 00:43:19,639
I've never done anything to betray our country.

958
00:43:19,639 --> 00:43:20,760
I can swear to heaven.

959
00:43:20,760 --> 00:43:21,519
I'll swear on my life.

960
00:43:21,519 --> 00:43:23,800
Do you dare swear before Mazu?

961
00:43:24,039 --> 00:43:25,360
Do you dare?

962
00:43:25,360 --> 00:43:26,159
He Chunxiao.

963
00:43:26,639 --> 00:43:27,880
Come see who's here!

964
00:43:27,880 --> 00:43:28,880
Boss Lin.

965
00:43:28,880 --> 00:43:30,559
I should've visited earlier.

966
00:43:33,719 --> 00:43:34,719
Don't get flustered.

967
00:43:34,719 --> 00:43:35,280
Let me help you.

968
00:43:35,480 --> 00:43:35,840
No need.

969
00:43:35,840 --> 00:43:36,440
Boss Lin.

970
00:43:36,599 --> 00:43:37,599
Please, have a seat.
